    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53286" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρδᾰμ-ον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nose-smart, Lepidium sativum</i>,
			of which the seed was eaten like mustard, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.2.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1429.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				3.39
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				234
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρδαμ᾽ ἐσκευασμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					36
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλέπειν κάρδαμα</span>
			look <i>sharp and stinging</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				455
			</span></i>: prov. of worthless things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσῳ διαφέρει σῦκα καρδάμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Henioch.
					4.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
